sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Microservicio (cliente Eureka)
    participant E as Eureka Server (:8761)

    S->>E: arranque: register-with-eureka
    S->>E: POST /eureka/apps/<service>
    E-->>S: 204 No Content
    loop cada 30s
        S->>E: heartbeat PUT /eureka/apps/<service>/<instance>
        E-->>S: 200
    end
    Note over S,E: El gateway y los servicios resuelven lb://<service> consultando el registro.
